{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>勞工處暫停兩間公司的補充勞工優化計劃申請。</p><p></p><p>涉事的是派比安洗滌有限公司及湊湊餐飲，在申請輸入勞工時，提交不實的全職本地僱員數目，及無持續符合本地僱員與輸入勞工2比1的人手比例要求。</p><p></p><p>勞工處即日起向兩間公司實施行政制裁，中止提交的輸入勞工申請，並拒絕處理隨後一年的申請。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:43:04.605593+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:38:28.827874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:40.062609+00:00","content_hash":"8383093982ee6b1caa2861bd670f63d354404b486eaff829d3177a38e89ae18c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:43:04.605593+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}